---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for authorSituation. Construct a realistic situation requiring the supplied procedure and meaningful information gathering. Separate facts visible at the start from facts revealed by appropriate questions, and include complications that test judgment without requiring unauthorized actions. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
